        "wiki": {
          "title": "Hell Pit",
          "url": "https://warhammerfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Hell_Pit",
          "description": "Hell Pit is perhaps one of the most horrific of all Skaven strongholds within the northern reaches of their subterranean Under-Empire. Founded in -1450 IC by Warlord Malkrit, this mighty stronghold of the Skaven lies to the far north of the Old World, in the blasted wasteland known as Troll Country, where the infernal breeding pits of Clan Moulder can be found. This bulgingly overpopulated Skaven stronghold is burrowed into the walls and floor of a ragged chasm in a snowy mountainside on the northern spur of the Worlds Edge Mountains.",
          "image": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/warhammerfb/images/e/e9/Hell_Pit.png/revision/latest?cb=20140526230949"
        },
