          "description": "Queekwell is a Skaven nest near Clan Skaar 's stronghold, located east of the Tilean city of Pavona, beneath the Apuccini Mountains. It is a small mining village, typical of any Skaven nest that claims allegiance to a nearby stronghold or warren. The sleepy, small town feeling of Queekwell is often interrupted by occasional earthquakes that seem to be centred in the mines themselves.",
