          "description": "Foul Peak is an hidden Skaven lair deep in the mountain range of The Vaults near the Tilean Principality of Miragliano. Controlled by Clan Ektrik, here a vast array of machinery connected to arcane lightning conductors sits atop the mountain's summit and hangs from the lair's ceiling. A horde of Warlock-Engineers tend to this array, harnessing the power of the storm-wracked skies, but to what diabolical purpose none can guess, and they will not tell.",
